# Hugo
public/
resources/_gen/
.hugo_build.lock

# NOTE: docs/ is intentionally NOT ignored.
# GitHub Pages is in LEGACY mode (source = main branch /docs).
# The live site IS main/docs, so build output must be committed.
# Ignoring docs/ caused the 2026-09-25 site-wide CSS outage:
# the new hashed main.min.<hash>.css was untracked -> not in main/docs -> 404 -> unstyled site.
# See TOOLS.md SOP 11.

